// In addition to outPublic and outPrivate, the TPM will build a
// TPMS_CREATION_DATA structure for the object. TPMS_CREATION_DATA.outsideInfo
// is set to outsideInfo. This structure is returned in creationData.
// Additionally, the digest of this structure is returned in creationHash, and,
// finally, a TPMT_TK_CREATION is created so that the association between the
// creation data and the object may be validated by TPM2_CertifyCreation().
